  "steps": [
    "Rinse the rice and dal together until the water runs clear and drain well.",
    "Heat the ghee in a pressure cooker and add the cumin seeds, hing, ginger and green chilli.",
    "Add the rice and dal with the turmeric and sauté for a minute.",
    "Pour in the water, add the salt and pressure cook for 3 whistles.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally, mash lightly and adjust the consistency with hot water if needed.",
    "Serve hot with a spoonful of ghee, curd or pickle."
  ]
